	(text "I2C1: PA15 SCL / PB7 SDA. SPS30 SEL=GND (I2C, 0x69); BME680 SDO=3V3 (0x77), CS=3V3. 4k7 pull-ups to 3V3 (R1, R2).\nI2C2 (RTC only): PC4 SCL / PA8 SDA. PCF8563 RTC HW-689 off-board on header J7 (VCC, GND, SDA, SCL; 0x51, CR1220, COT and INT unused). 4k7 pull-ups to 3V3 (R24 SCL, R23 SDA)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 345.44 0)
		(effects
