				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "243732f3-38f8-5e55-bd93-822687aa6b09")
	)
	(text "Buzzer: PB10 (BUZZER_ON) -> R9 1k -> Q3 2N2222A base. Q3 switches the 12V buzzer on its low side: PB10 HIGH -> buzzer ON, LOW -> OFF.\nIndicator LEDs: PA6 (LED_DATA, TIM16_CH1 PWM + DMA, 800 kHz) -> U6A 74AHCT125N (DIP-14 socket, 5V) -> R25 330 -> J9 (1 +5V, 2 DIN, 3 GND) to a WS2812B chain on the panel. C27 220uF bulk at J9, C26 100nF at U6. U6B-D unused: inputs to GND, OE to +5V.\nDisplay: J10 (1 3V3, 2 GND, 3 SDA, 4 SCL) on I2C2 with the RTC; not used by the firmware yet.\nButtons: J11 (1-4 KEY1-KEY4, 5 GND), each key shorts its pin to GND. Ladder on PB11 (BUTTONS_ADC, ADC2_IN14): R26 10k pull-up to 3V3, R27 1k / R28 3k3 / R29 6k8 / R30 15k to KEY1-4, C28 100nF to GND.\nMiCS-4514 PRE tied to GND (boost not used). MQ131 heater runs on a steady 5 V (VCC/GND straight to the rails, no switch). Cold/warm boot button SW2 -> PB2 (BOOT_MODE, pull-up). Gate PB9 (TRIAC_DIMMER) -> RobotDyn PSM."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 358.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "271c2dbd-78bc-55da-a774-def13076086d")
	)
	(text "5V outputs -> 1k8 (series) / 3k3 (to GND) divider -> 3.24V max at MCU pin:\nMQ131 AO -> PA0 (ADC1_IN1), MiCS RED -> PA1 (ADC2_IN2), MiCS NOX -> PA7 (ADC2_IN4), RobotDyn Z-C -> PB12 (EXTI12, falling edge)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 350.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3871ab3e-4ce4-5f49-8861-3354221e38b4")
	)
	(text "WeAct STM32G474CEU6 Long (A1): 5V from PS1 into P3 VDD5V (pins 43/44). 3V3 from the on-board LDO (P4 pins 47/48, P5 pin 52).\nPin map: clear-air.ioc + README \"STM32G474CEU6 Pin Plan\". On-board only: PC6 user LED (LED_BOARD), PC13 user key, PB8 BOOT0 key,\nPA11/PA12 USB-C, PF0/PF1 8 MHz HSE, PC14/PC15 LSE. VREF+ (pin 37) tied to 3V3 so the ADCs read against 3.3V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 335.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "502a1d97-eb91-5cca-997b-f23c61f72e02")
	)
	(text "220VAC mains split: J1 -> RobotDyn TRIAC (fan) and two separate AC-DC supplies (12V 2A: buzzer + M2/M3 fans, 5V 2A: board + peripherals).\nOff board (on_board no): J1, M1 and the AC side of PS1 and U5, wired with 1.5 mm2 copper. The sensor modules (SPS30, BME680, MQ131, MiCS-4514) are off the PCB and are connected with wires to the PCB wire headers J3 (SPS30), J4 (BME680), J5 (MQ131) and J6 (MiCS-4514); the pin order is in each header's Value. PS1 pins: 1 L, 2 N, 3 +12V, 4 +5V, 5 GND; the DC pins go to two 2-pin headers. U5 logic pins 1-4 go to a 4-pin header. Fans M2 (front) and M3 (rear) are 12V 4-pin 80 mm: 1 GND, 2 +12V, 3 TACH, 4 PWM. M2 PWM -> PA10 (TIM1_CH3), TACH -> PA5 (TIM2_CH1). M3 PWM -> PA9 (TIM1_CH2), TACH -> PB3 (TIM2_CH2). PWM has 1k series (R19, R20); tach has 10k pull-up to +3V3 (R21, R22)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 375.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9c7a92c2-2f06-54d7-b8d7-bf4eabe74f93")
	)
	(text "HIGH VOLTAGE: J1, PS1 pins 1-2, RobotDyn IN/N/OUT, M1 carry 220VAC."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 420 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b9d78abb-c294-51c2-9de3-52d4b88838d1")
	)
	(text "J2 = STLINK-V3MINIE STDC14: 3 T_VCC, 4 SWDIO, 5/7/11 GND, 6 SWCLK, 12 T_NRST, 13 T_VCP_RX, 14 T_VCP_TX; 1/2/8/9/10 unused.\nSWD goes to the board P5 header (SWCLK/SWDIO/3V3/GND). USART2 VCP: PA2 TX -> T_VCP_TX, PA3 RX <- T_VCP_RX."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 370.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ea359ce6-a477-5ddc-86e8-6134661f9193")
	)
