	(text "Test buttons SW3-SW6 (on board): ladder on PA4 (FORCE_STATES_SW).\nTEST1 fan off, TEST2 fan lower, TEST3 fan higher,\nTEST4 100% fan + buzzer. 0.30 / 0.82 / 1.34 / 1.98 V.\nStandby: SW7 or J12 (external) pulls PB1 to GND.\nD2 red: on by default (R40 pulls PB0 node to 3V3).\nPB0 high: red on, green off. PB0 low: green on."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
