	(text "Fan power switch: PB5 (FILTER_FAN_POWER) high -> R41 -> Q6 on -> relay K1 (ALDP112, 12V coil) closes and feeds 12V to both fans (M2, M3 pin 2).\nPB5 low or not driven: relay open, fans have no power (standby). D3 is the coil flyback diode."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 250.19 52.07 0)
